lations  Committee which is overseeing all our  war things after senator bob Corker of  tennessee retires Oh  Oh anyway the next day was the deadline  day the day that this thing had to be  signed and it was also the day of the  funeral for her representative Louise  slaughter of New York and it was just it  was kind of crazy to me that this was  the day that this was going to be signed  into law because Louise slaughter was  one of only four Democrats that sat on  the House Rules Committee so she would  have been in the only hearing about this  omnibus and she would have been furious  and for all the right reasons but anyway  you know while her funeral was taking  place the bill had passed the house and  it had passed the Senate in identical  form and all it needed was Trump's  signature and of course literally five  minutes before Louise slaughter funeral  we got a Trump tweet he said quote I am  considering a veto in all caps of the  omnibus spending bill based on the fact  that the 800,000 Plus daca recipients  have been totally abandoned by the  Democrats not even mentioned in bill and  the border wall all caps which is  desperately needed for our national  defense is not fully funded and then he  signed it four hours later and so that's  how the Republican Party is funding the  operations of our government  and as their employers how does this  story make you feel about their job  performance please make sure to call and  tell David at two one nine two david p  the video you just finished watching was  made possible by you through the  membership program you can sign up for  membership at david pakman.com slash  membership we are viewer supported  independent media you can use the coupon  code  I voted 17 for a 40% discount off of  your membership

